re/bz5h%20human%20talkerf%20f","title":"Creature (variant 47)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz5h%20human%20jug%20f","title":"Creature (variant 48)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz5h%20human%20pod%20m","title":"Creature (variant 49)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz5h%20human%20fireman%20m","title":"Creature (variant 50)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz2h%20human%20feiruz%20m","title":"Feiruz (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/horse%20red","title":"Horse","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone1%20hyena","title":"Young hyena","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zebra","title":"Zebra","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz2h","title":"Suslanger and its surroundings","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Black market</h1><h2>Setting</h2><p>The black market brings together craftspeople, illicit trade and local information. Master Arkhar and the fortune-teller offer very different services here. For conspicuous fugitives such as Kir and Kel, useful contacts are as valuable as equipment. [1, 2, 3]</p><h2>The meteorite and Feiruz’s favour</h2><p>Rindeil wants a meteorite sample brought from the lands the Khadaganians call useless. He has arranged to exchange it for a rare addition to his collection. Kir overhears the guards to locate the sample, but its locked chest calls for a better thief. Karim directs him to Feiruz at the Black Market. Kel challenges Feiruz’s pride until he agrees to help, on condition that they return the favour later. He opens the chest, earns Kel’s praise and leaves the party to rest. Rindeil rewards the delivery. The unpaid favour explains why Feiruz later expects help rescuing Aliya. [4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals, event scripts and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>World description · Black market (zone bz5h)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/nsheriff\">Master Arkhar</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing nsheriff_about)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/skelet\">Fortune-teller</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing skelet_about)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Rindeil</a> (briefing brief_18)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Rindeil</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_20)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/sheriff\">Karim</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_22)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Feiruz</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_23)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Feiruz</a> (briefing brief_24)</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Rindeil</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_25)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Quest journal · Meteorite Fever (quest q5h)</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>Quest journal · The Black Market (quest q7h)</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Quest journal · Heavenly Iron (quest q8h)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/suslanger\">Suslanger</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz2h\">Suslanger a